OL,5,MGORBACHEV WINS WIDER EXECUTIVE POWERS
OL,7, 103FCongress backs US-style presidency
OL,8, 104FParty's leading role abandoned
OL,9, 126FConcessions gain huge majority
OL,11, 115 IRAFCourt frees two convicted men
