OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGSOVIET CONGRESS APPROVES
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGEXECUTIVE PRESIDENT
OL,4,D
OL,5, The Soviet Congress of People's
OL,6, Deputies has created a new post of
OL,7, president with wider powers.
OL,9,FThe Soviet parliament voted by 1,817 in
OL,10,Ffavour of the proposals, backed by
OL,11,FPresident Gorbachev, with 133 votes
OL,12,Fagainst and 61 abstentions.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FSupporters of the new law said it was
OL,15,Fneeded to implement reforms, guarantee
OL,16,Flaw and order and help the country with
OL,17,Fits economic problems.
OL,19,FA BBC correspondent says the Congress
OL,20,Fis expected to vote Mr Gorbachev in as
OL,21,Fthe new executive president.
OL,23,T]FFromG13-03-90F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,190,120,250,0,100
